{"items":[{"str":"happened when those individuals were children)? What are the impli-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,649],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"cations for dealing with the question of what Taubin calls “institu-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,635],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"tionalized violence” in the social order? What do they say about what","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,621],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"the problem is, and what the solution to the problem might be? In","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,607],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"the case of serial killers, individuals who threaten other individuals,","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,593],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"the solution seems relatively simple: kill the serial killer and your","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,579],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"problem goes away.","dir":"ltr","width":88,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,565],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"According to Taubin,","dir":"ltr","width":96,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,168,551],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Unlike urban action pictures, which imply that the threat to America is","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,526],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ghettoised, serial killer films are set in white neighborhoods—suburbia,","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,513],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"the farm belt, the back woods. And in fact, almost all serial killers are","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,500],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"white males who kill within their own racial group. Bred in the heart-","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,487],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"lands, he’s the deformed version of the American dream of the individ-","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,474],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ual. (16)","dir":"ltr","width":35,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,461],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"What does it mean to locate the “deformation” of the American","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,435],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"dream not in corrupt government, in economic institutions that ex-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,421],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ploit us, or in systemic corruption, but in an individual?","dir":"ltr","width":248,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,407],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"If this is the general gist of serial killer narratives, then how does","dir":"ltr","width":300,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,168,393],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,379],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"The Silence of the Lambs","dir":"ltr","width":104,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,379],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,260,379],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"buttress this view of the world and the sources","dir":"ltr","width":205,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,263,379],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"of violence in U.S. society, and how does it depart from the model","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,365],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"outlined? Can this departure be at all described as progressive? Taubin","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,351],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"wants to make the argument that","dir":"ltr","width":156,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,337],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,312,337],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"The Silence of the Lambs","dir":"ltr","width":110,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,316,337],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,427,337],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"is doing","dir":"ltr","width":37,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,431,337],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"something special with this narrative by suggesting what we already","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,323],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"know: that violence in our society is not a primarily individualized","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,309],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"thing, that it is not only located in specific individuals with localizable","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,295],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"and private sources, but in a whole legacy and history of American cul-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,281],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"ture.","dir":"ltr","width":21,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,267],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,168,253],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"The Silence of the Lambs","dir":"ltr","width":105,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,168,253],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":" ","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[10,0,0,10,273,253],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"is, Taubin remarks, “packed with 300 years","dir":"ltr","width":192,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,276,253],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"of relics—of white America. Every time Lecter sends Clarice on a trea-","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,239],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"sure hunt—to a storage warehouse for example—she finds a flag or","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,225],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"two tucked away with the rusty rifles, dressmakers’ dummies and the","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,211],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"odd severed head preserved in a jar. The flags look as though they’ve","dir":"ltr","width":312,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,197],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"seen better days.”","dir":"ltr","width":79,"height":10,"transform":[10,0,0,10,156,183],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Near the end of the film, in the aftermath of Clarice’s battle with Buf-","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,158],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"falo Bill, the camera lingers for a moment in a corner of the killer’s lair,","dir":"ltr","width":288,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,168,145],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,216,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":true},{"str":"Cultural Studies, Popular Culture, and Pedagogy","dir":"ltr","width":191,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,216,677],"fontName":"g_d2896_f3","hasEOL":false},{"str":"","dir":"ltr","width":0,"height":0,"transform":[9,0,0,9,299,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":true},{"str":"| 30 |","dir":"ltr","width":26,"height":9,"transform":[9,0,0,9,299,117],"fontName":"g_d2896_f2","hasEOL":false}],"styles":{"g_d2896_f2":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false},"g_d2896_f3":{"fontFamily":"serif","ascent":0.722,"descent":-0.246,"vertical":false}},"lang":null}